WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.635
"Yay!" said Harry.

2
00:00:08.636 --> 00:00:18.029
"We're going camping!"

3
00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:21.784
Mom put the tent and food in the car.

4
00:00:21.785 --> 00:00:28.677
Dad put the sleeping bags in the car.

5
00:00:28.678 --> 00:00:31.818
The kids played in the yard.

6
00:00:31.819 --> 00:00:38.181
Harry threw a stick.

7
00:00:38.182 --> 00:00:41.799
Rover ran after it.

8
00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:44.951
"Everybody in the car!" Dad said.

9
00:00:44.952 --> 00:00:50.276
Rover looked for the stick.

10
00:00:50.277 --> 00:00:54.062
"It's time to go camping, Rover," said Harry.

11
00:00:54.063 --> 00:01:03.858
Rover was still looking for the stick.

12
00:01:03.859 --> 00:01:11.647
Everybody pulled Rover into the car.

13
00:01:11.648 --> 00:01:14.824
"Here we go!" said Dad.

14
00:01:14.825 --> 00:01:27.659
Dad drove, and Rover barked loudly.

15
00:01:27.660 --> 00:01:36.907
Soon they were in the woods.

16
00:01:36.908 --> 00:01:41.890
Mom and Harry set up the tent.

17
00:01:41.891 --> 00:01:48.593
Dad and Emmy made a campfire.

18
00:01:48.594 --> 00:01:53.102
Oliver found bugs.

19
00:01:53.103 --> 00:01:58.440
Rover sniffed all around.

20
00:01:58.441 --> 00:02:02.655
Dad cooked dinner over the fire.

21
00:02:02.656 --> 00:02:10.276
Everybody ate.

22
00:02:10.277 --> 00:02:13.093
"It's getting dark," said Dad.

23
00:02:13.094 --> 00:02:16.755
We need to tie up our food.

24
00:02:16.756 --> 00:02:20.958
There are bears in the woods."

25
00:02:20.959 --> 00:02:23.993
"Bears?" Harry looked around.

26
00:02:23.994 --> 00:02:27.054
"Bears?" Emmy looked around.

27
00:02:27.055 --> 00:02:32.262
"I like bears," said Oliver.

28
00:02:32.263 --> 00:02:34.728
Suddenly the bushes moved.

29
00:02:34.729 --> 00:02:41.087
"Is it a bear?" asked Emmy.

30
00:02:41.088 --> 00:02:43.872
A sound came from the bushes.

31
00:02:43.873 --> 00:02:53.724
"It must be a bear," said Harry.

32
00:02:53.725 --> 00:02:57.308
"Woof! Woof!" Rover jumped out.

33
00:02:57.309 --> 00:03:03.496
Rover had a new stick.

